00:48:25.940 --> 00:48:27.040
It's in the deleted scenes.
它在删减片段里。

1101
00:48:27.280 --> 00:48:31.860
In this deleted talking head, Angela Martin says, this is not my first commercial.
在这段被删减的采访中，安吉拉·马丁说，这不是我第一次拍广告。

